person_upvote.template:
You are predicting the behaviour of one Product Hunt member on one day.
This member's most recent upvotes before today (newest first; product - tagline):
{history}

Today's launches (numbered). A launch marked [follows team] is by a hunter or maker this member follows.
{lineup}

For EACH launch, give the probability (0 to 1) that this member upvotes it today. Members usually upvote only a few launches a day.
Return JSON {{"p": [probability for launch 1, launch 2, ... in order]}}

launch_level.template:
A product is launching on Product Hunt today (about 25-40 launches compete on a typical day; ranking is by upvotes over the day).
Product: {name} - {tagline}
Topics: {topics}
Description: {description}

Give the probability (0 to 1) that it finishes in the day's top 10, and the probability that it finishes in the day's top 3.
Return JSON {{"p_top10": <0-1>, "p_top3": <0-1>}}

pairwise.template:
