Product A: {a_name} - {a_tagline}
Topics: {a_topics}
{a_desc}

Product B: {b_name} - {b_tagline}
Topics: {b_topics}
{b_desc}

Which one will get more upvotes today? Return JSON {{"winner": "A" or "B", "p_a": <probability 0-1 that A gets more upvotes>}}
